OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 18 APR
OL,4,G0900FSaturday Morning
OL,5,     GTom Service with the perfect
OL,6,     Gclassical soundtrack for the
OL,7,     Gweekend. With an exclusive
OL,8,     Gsession from violinist Alena
OL,9,     GBaeva, plus harpist Lavinia
OL,10,     GMeijer chats about her new album.
OL,11,G1200FEarlier... with Jools Holland
OL,12,     GJools is joined by architectural
OL,13,     Ghistorian Sir Charles Saumarez
OL,14,     GSmith to explore the life and
OL,15,     Gwork of 18th-century architect
OL,16,     Gand playwright John Vanbrugh, who
OL,17,     Gdied 300 years ago.
OL,18,G1300FKey Changes: Radio 3's Essential
OL,19,     FHistory of Classical Music
OL,20,     GThe year is 1182. Notre-Dame de
OL,21,     GParis is consecrated, and new
OL,22,     Gmusical ideas are born.
